      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Oh... you actually did it. By painstakingly crafting, compressing, and violently fusing dozens of lower-tier stars together, you have forged the Klein Star Omega. The sheer density of this crystal is baffling; it gently hums with the contained power of a small star. This is no longer just a battery. It is, without a shadow of a doubt, the absolute fattest power bank in the known universe.\n\nFunctionally, this absolute unit of a crystal holds a staggering 51,200,000 EMC. With the Omega Star sitting snugly in your inventory, any EMC-draining tools, rings, or terraforming lenses you use will essentially have an infinite, bottomless power supply. More importantly, this absurdly dense energy core is a mandatory, hyper-expensive crafting component for your final descent into endgame alchemy. Congratulations on surviving the crafting tree!",
